    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you wake up in an unknown place with no memories and no understanding of what is happening. Gradually, you discover a unique ability: to control time. Freeze moving objects, rewind time, and use this advantage to overcome increasingly complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate time to your advantage to escape traps, interact with the environment in unexpected ways, and overcome obstacles that require logic and creativity.</p>",
